      "updated": 1779017187353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mechanism - Maintaining Hosts:",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Mechanism - Maintaining Hosts:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_ObcpciQoAcfN94Tc5jFU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1259.6322742250545,
      "y": 11046.052707652016,
      "width": 439.15380859375,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "eIfytY_jARQ-HNbXhIQJR"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5nJV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1236904736,
      "version": 2551,
      "versionNonce": 196448090,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779017187353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mechanism - Running Application:",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Mechanism - Running Application:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9odOFgv5qtF-qB4OiyfN0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -911.8372726129774,
      "y": 11152.19255134758,
      "width": 1117.9189453125,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "Ny1f-qlca-e8MiXNsP6-a"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5nK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 699166432,
      "version": 3361,
      "versionNonce": 264147994,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779017187353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The provisioning module takes care of validating a join request into the provisioning group,\nand maintaining connection to those machines.\n\nThe machines would have to pull the host application code, setup it's environment with\nsome variables, then publish a message to declare that they are ready to run applications\nfrom the spaces.\n\nWhen the provisioning service (or later service workers) receive this message, it will validate the credentials,\nand if valid, will open a tcp connection to the hosts, the host can then start sending messages every\nsome period of time, the provisioning service's role here is then to keep appending logs of the status of the host.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The provisioning module takes care of validating a join request into the provisioning group,\nand maintaining connection to those machines.\n\nThe machines would have to pull the host application code, setup it's environment with\nsome variables, then publish a message to declare that they are ready to run applications\nfrom the spaces.\n\nWhen the provisioning service (or later service workers) receive this message, it will validate the credentials,\nand if valid, will open a tcp connection to the hosts, the host can then start sending messages every\nsome period of time, the provisioning service's role here is then to keep appending logs of the status of the host.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3eYJ9qtx34KRn7RBE9Q3D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -919.2650977969906,
      "y": 11455.584855997002,
      "width": 1257.9586181640625,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "K_mBA6H7n6s95IvLKVKKg"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5nK8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 316627855,
      "version": 3973,
      "versionNonce": 1573454042,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779017187353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The provisioning channel is especially important for new hosts to be able to join the provisioning group, they don't need to know\nwhich service they need to talk to, simply declare that they are ready to serve apps.\n\nThe provisioning microservice consumes this declaration message and establish direct tcp connection to them,\nnow fully aware of the hosts existence, further communication (ping, running apps), happen through this channel.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The provisioning channel is especially important for new hosts to be able to join the provisioning group, they don't need to know\nwhich service they need to talk to, simply declare that they are ready to serve apps.\n\nThe provisioning microservice consumes this declaration message and establish direct tcp connection to them,\nnow fully aware of the hosts existence, further communication (ping, running apps), happen through this channel.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xWa2ByLS5vhTTSodLO_2o",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1260.1876300841484,
      "y": 11097.474346760573,
      "width": 965.4990844726562,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "OmnyCJfG9MJH5QfEB3fm9"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5nKG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 932661024,
      "version": 4721,
      "versionNonce": 23582106,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779017187354,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The provisioning service tracks the state of the hosts, The service keeps an in-memory\ncopy of a subset of registered hosts from the database.\n\nThe goal of copying this data is so the service can derive a data structure to make\ndeciding which host to run the applications on efficiently while the best utilization of \nall registered hosts.\n\nThe goal of copying this data is so the service can derive a data structure to make\ndeciding which host to run the applications on efficiently while the best utilization of \nall registered hosts. \n\nFor starter, this data structure can be a simple list, to get the next host on top of which\nto run the app, find the first matching item (host having enough resource), \nsend a message for it to pull metadata from the space module, pull the source code, build, and run.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The provisioning service tracks the state of the hosts, The service keeps an in-memory\ncopy of a subset of registered hosts from the database.\n\nThe goal of copying this data is so the service can derive a data structure to make\ndeciding which host to run the applications on efficiently while the best utilization of \nall registered hosts.\n\nThe goal of copying this data is so the service can derive a data structure to make\ndeciding which host to run the applications on efficiently while the best utilization of \nall registered hosts. \n\nFor starter, this data structure can be a simple list, to get the next host on top of which\nto run the app, find the first matching item (host having enough resource), \nsend a message for it to pull metadata from the space module, pull the source code, build, and run.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
