      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779017187354,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The provisioning module keeps track of individual provisioning hosts' health, when a host becomes unavailable (failed to keep the heartbeat),\nThe provisioning service quickly detects this, and find a new host to run the app, i.e migrating app.\n\n\nUpon successful migration, the provisioning service publish a \"deployment_updated\" to the deployment channel.\n\nThe deployment channel consumes this message, appends a log, and invoke the PUT /app-hosts once again, now updating the interface to\npoint to the new reverse proxy host. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The provisioning module keeps track of individual provisioning hosts' health, when a host becomes unavailable (failed to keep the heartbeat),\nThe provisioning service quickly detects this, and find a new host to run the app, i.e migrating app.\n\n\nUpon successful migration, the provisioning service publish a \"deployment_updated\" to the deployment channel.\n\nThe deployment channel consumes this message, appends a log, and invoke the PUT /app-hosts once again, now updating the interface to\npoint to the new reverse proxy host. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
