      "version": 180,
      "versionNonce": 723824211,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779519526463,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deployment Flow",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deployment Flow",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LU7DH5g9dliv3NlJqQ7R9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3872.1774661505497,
      "y": 15094.369037227552,
      "width": 818.1616821289062,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 214457821,
      "version": 224,
      "versionNonce": 401764829,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779519522241,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "At this stage, the app is deployed as a single process monolith, and all user applications are deployed to\na single host, the same as the machine that runs the Capybara Platform.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "At this stage, the app is deployed as a single process monolith, and all user applications are deployed to\na single host, the same as the machine that runs the Capybara Platform.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "81zTvjZQNS3LYVqixy3xU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3870.8922834916134,
      "y": 15253.11649267364,
      "width": 745.841552734375,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAs",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 456433949,
      "version": 202,
      "versionNonce": 624790013,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779519605128,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Assumptions:\n\n- Users, Organizations, Projects, Applications, and Application Config first have to be created. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Assumptions:\n\n- Users, Organizations, Projects, Applications, and Application Config first have to be created. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ItXKxcSmOtTiqRqRhULRe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3873.881248474461,
      "y": 15346.637661933999,
      "width": 978.2899780273438,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 396502931,
      "version": 904,
      "versionNonce": 2100142237,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779519981283,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Desired Outcome:\n\n- Upon successful deployment, the application should be discoverable within the same host (localhost) at a random port.\nthe application instance should be recorded in the database and retrievable from REST API.\n\n- The Deployment happens asynnchronously, a user requests for deployment, on valid requests, a deployment item is returned,\nand the Back-end continue processing in the background, therefore it needs some kind of status tracking.\n  ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Desired Outcome:\n\n- Upon successful deployment, the application should be discoverable within the same host (localhost) at a random port.\nthe application instance should be recorded in the database and retrievable from REST API.\n\n- The Deployment happens asynnchronously, a user requests for deployment, on valid requests, a deployment item is returned,\nand the Back-end continue processing in the background, therefore it needs some kind of status tracking.\n  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
